==Trivia==
*Each of the first three exclusive units are based on different characters:
**Secret Crush Cat's design and Normal Form's descriptions match [[wikia:tokimemo:Shiori Fujisaki|Shiori Fujisaki]] from the dating sim series ''[[wikipedia:Tokimeki Memorial|Tokimeki Memorial]]'', except that her uniform is a darker shade of blue and has a red tie.
**Iron-Masked Lion Cat is a reference to Yoko Godai from the television series ''[[wikipedia:Sukeban Deka#Television series|Sukeban Deka II: The Legend of the Girl In The Iron Mask]]'', a schoolgirl who spent most of her life wearing a similar iron mask and has a uniform with the same exact colors.
**Chalkboard Punk Cat is a reference to Masami Iwaki from ''[[wikipedia:Dokaben|Dokaben]]'', who is typically seen with an identical-looking student cap and a two-leaved twig in his mouth.
*Class Rep Cat is incorrectly labelled as Chairman Cat on the Heartbeat Catcademy Event Gacha.
*None of the units from this banner can be upgraded past Lv.1, instead requiring +levels to reach key level thresholds like Lv.10.
**Excluding [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]], the Heartbeat Catcademy Cats and the [[JRA Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|JRA Collaboration Event]] Cats are the only deployable units with this restriction.

